# Buster Sword: two Swords on the Ornithopter make it 6/6 (0/2 + 3/2 + 3/2); its 6 damage triggers each Sword once (CR 603.2c),
# so Bot1 draws twice and may cast twice, each by the 6 damage dealt. The first draw is Cease // Desist: both halves fit (Cease 2,
# Desist 6), so Bot1 is asked which half is cast (CR 709.3) and chooses Cease: it targets nothing in a graveyard, and Bot1 gains 2
# life and draws a card. Desist is not cast (every artifact is still there). The second draw is Lightning Bolt (MV 1), cast free at
# Bot2: 20 - 6 - 3 = 11.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Buster Sword
Buster Sword
Cease // Desist
Lightning Bolt
Plains x13

